#NEXUS

[ martínez2016a_fig10: Five-tip rectangular tree; each branch ends beside a coloured 3D endocast rendering, and the names are printed by the renderings, not at the branch ends (the reader must pair each branch with its rendering: Spinophorosaurus top, Diplodocus, Camarasaurus, Sarmientosaurus, Uzbekistan lithostrotian bottom). A scale bar sits below the tree; it is not a time axis. Region note for a person: the renderings fill most of the image. 5 tips, fully resolved. Sample 10 case (census 3, seed 20261274). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=5;
    TAXLABELS
        Spinophorosaurus
        Diplodocus
        Camarasaurus
        Sarmientosaurus
        Uzbekistan_lithostrotian
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE martínez2016a_fig10 = [&R] (Spinophorosaurus,(Diplodocus,(Camarasaurus,(Sarmientosaurus,Uzbekistan_lithostrotian))));
END;
